deployed: 2026-05-12T02:00:00Z · v1.0.62 (Two bugs from v1.0.60/61 fixed.

BUG 1 — Pinned widgets (clones of terminal panes) stayed stale. Smart Wallets pinned to the chart still showed hardcoded ETH-style placeholder addresses with KOL/SNIPER/WHALE tags instead of the GoldRush "config required" empty state or live data. Root cause: when a player pins a pane to the chart, the widget system CLONES the .crTerm-pane DOM. Both source + clone have data-pane-id="solSmart". My v1.0.60 used querySelector which returned only the source (the hidden one in the closed terminal). Fix: switched _bodyOf → _bodiesOf using querySelectorAll, updated _setBody/_setHdTag to forEach over every match. All 6 Layer B refreshers now update source AND every pinned clone simultaneously.

BUG 2 — ⚙ gear button invisible in Token Terminal header. Probable root cause: splash CSS overrides on .os-wbar reverse the flex order, so insertBefore(gear, close) put the button off-screen behind other chrome. Fix: gear is now a floating absolute-positioned button at top:6px right:8px inside .os-wbody. Bigger label "⚙ SETTINGS" with mint-green pill styling + hover glow + stopPropagation on click. Settings panel adjusted to top:34px right:8px so it slides in below the gear cleanly. z-index ordering: gear=6, panel=7.)
